C8:2E:47:11:22:33/random MX Keys                      keyboard        LE     **   -64     no
B8:D5:0B:12:34:56        Beats Studio                 headphones      BR/EDR ***  -55     no

# bluetooth pair "mx master"
pairing with F4:73:35:12:34:56/random...
paired with F4:73:35:12:34:56/random

# bluetooth pair "mx keys"
pairing with C8:2E:47:11:22:33/random...
Type 123456 on C8:2E:47:11:22:33/random, then press Enter on it
paired with C8:2E:47:11:22:33/random

# bluetooth pair beats
pairing with B8:D5:0B:12:34:56...
paired with B8:D5:0B:12:34:56

# bluetooth connect beats
connected to B8:D5:0B:12:34:56 (A2DPSink,AVRCP,HFP)

