.Ed
.Pp
A pane pairing without a terminal:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ bluetooth pair 00:1B:66:AA:BB:CC --no-prompt
address=00:1B:66:AA:BB:CC method=numeric-comparison passkey=482913 expires=59
$ echo $?
3
$ bluetooth confirm 00:1B:66:AA:BB:CC yes
.Ed
.Pp
