.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -tag -width "cannot reach org.nextbsd.bluetooth"
.It Sy cannot reach org.nextbsd.bluetooth \(em is bluetoothd running?
The Mach service lookup failed.
Check
.Ql launchctl list | grep bluetoothd
and
.Pa /var/log/bluetoothd.stderr .
.It Sy no Bluetooth adapters
No controller is present, or none has been brought up yet.
.Ql bluetooth status
shows whether firmware is still loading.
.It Sy adapter is powered off
Turn it on with
.Ql bluetooth power on .
.It Sy no device called ...
The name matches no paired device and nothing the last scan found.
Run
.Cm scan
with the device in pairing mode, or give its address.
.It Sy ... matches more than one device
Give more of the name, or the address.
.It Sy only root can send raw HCI commands
Run
.Cm hci
as root.
.It Sy the controller did not answer
The command got no Command Complete or Command Status within 5 seconds.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bluetoothd 8 ,
.Xr scutil 8 ,
.Xr wlan 8
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
first appeared in NextBSD in 2026.
.Sh BUGS
.Cm hci
shows only the event that answers the command, not the events a command
answered by Command Status produces later, such as an inquiry's results.
.Pp
While
.Cm ping ,
.Cm sdp
or
.Cm hci
waits on a device or the controller, other
.Nm
commands wait behind it.
